--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -190,6 +190,9 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Keep anonymous-component parent data available to `@aware`.** Hover, completion and navigation follow supplied ancestor values and rendered named slots, preserve supplied null, and refresh after unsaved caller changes. Dynamic and class-provided data remains conservative where its exposed keys cannot be established. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
+
 - **Keep supplied model types in Blade component props.** Required props retain caller types, and defaults fill missing or null values without overriding supplied data. Explicit PHPDoc contracts remain authoritative. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Keep Laravel view navigation current when templates are added or removed.** Custom roots, published package views, external view configuration changes, and Blade/plain PHP precedence refresh without restarting. Contributed by @thinkycz.
